{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Temporal.Zoned_datetime</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Zoned_datetime","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Wall-clock times in a time zone.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-kind\"><a href=\"#type-kind\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> kind</span><span> = </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-kind.Unique\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kind.Unique\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Unique</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Exactly one instant.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-kind.Gap\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kind.Gap\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Gap</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>None: the clocks skipped it.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-kind.Fold\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kind.Fold\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span><span class=\"constructor\">Fold</span></span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Two: the clocks repeated it.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>How a wall-clock time maps to instants in its zone.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.zone\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.zone\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>zone : string;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.civil\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.civil\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>civil : <a href=\"../Datetime/index.html#type-t\">Datetime.t</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.kind\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.kind\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>kind : <a href=\"#type-kind\">kind</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.offset_before\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.offset_before\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>offset_before : <a href=\"../Offset/index.html#type-t\">Offset.t</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.offset_after\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.offset_after\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>offset_after : <a href=\"../Offset/index.html#type-t\">Offset.t</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.fold\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.fold\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>fold : bool;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.offset\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.offset\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>offset : <a href=\"../Offset/index.html#type-t\">Offset.t</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.instant\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.instant\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>instant : <a href=\"../Instant/index.html#type-t\">Instant.t</a>;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A wall-clock time and its resolved instant in <code>zone</code>. <code>kind</code> identifies a unique time, gap or fold. <code>offset_before</code> and <code>offset_after</code> are the offsets on either side of the transition; both equal the resolved offset for a unique time. <code>fold</code> selects the later instant when <code>true</code>. A gap resolves using <code>offset_before</code>. <code>offset</code> is <a href=\"../Offset/index.html#type-t.Unknown\"><code>Offset.t.Unknown</code></a> for <a href=\"../index.html#val-unknown_zone\"><code>unknown_zone</code></a> and opaque zones.</p><p>To convert to another date library, use <code>civil</code>, <code>zone</code> and <code>fold</code>, or <code>instant</code> for a gap. Avoid using the offsets: they may differ between database versions.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_string\"><a href=\"#val-to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>to_string zoned</code> formats <code>zoned</code>, in the form of RFC 9557: <code>2024-03-10T01:30:00-05:00[America/New_York]</code>, with <code>[gap]</code> appended to a skipped wall time and <code>[fold=0]</code> or <code>[fold=1]</code> to a repeated one, and <code>Z</code> for the offset in <a href=\"../index.html#val-unknown_zone\"><code>unknown_zone</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp\"><a href=\"#val-pp\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>pp formatter zoned</code> prints <code>to_string zoned</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>sexp_of_t zoned</code> is <code>to_string zoned</code> as an atom.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal\"><a href=\"#val-equal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>equal a b</code> returns whether <code>a</code> and <code>b</code> have the same fields.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>compare a b</code> is a total order consistent with <a href=\"#val-equal\"><code>equal</code></a>: by zone name, then wall time.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hegel_generator\"><a href=\"#val-hegel_generator\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hegel_generator : <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"../../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Equivalent to <code>zoned_datetimes ()</code> with the bundled database. Unaffected by <a href=\"../index.html#val-set_default_zone_source\"><code>set_default_zone_source</code></a>.</p></div></div>"}